{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/2108", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/2108/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/2108/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/2108/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/2108", "id": 3141459705, "node_id": "I_kwDOLW-eZs67Pt75", "number": 2108, "title": "[field][Control] onValueChange `value` type", "user": {"login": "cgatian", "id": 1752170, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTIxNzA=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1752170?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/cgatian", "html_url": "https://github.com/cgatian", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 6619596510, "node_id": "LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio8G3g", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/type:%20bug", "name": "type: bug", "color": "e11d21", "default": false, "description": "It doesn't behave as expected.", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 6621343555, "node_id": "LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABiqmvQw", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/typescript", "name": "typescript", "color": "006b75", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7205061925, "node_id": "LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABrXSFJQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20field", "name": "component: field", "color": "ffffff", "default": false, "description": "Changes related to the field component.", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 1, "created_at": "2025-06-12T20:17:30Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-10T19:45:35Z", "closed_at": "2025-06-16T04:41:01Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "# Bug report\n\n## Current behavior\n\nThe `Field.Control` (`Input`) prop `onValueChange` is incorrect.\nThe current type of `onValueChange` is as follows:\n\nhttps://github.com/mui/base-ui/blob/7ca8cd95a367d60f26265baa4cc539801c398be2/packages/react/src/field/control/FieldControl.tsx#L162\n\nThe `value` argument is set to the following:\n```tsx\nReact.ComponentProps<'input'>['value']\n```\n\nThe `React.ComponentProps<'input'>['value']` type is a union of four types:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a4fd3127-bf27-4219-9224-13803f79ebe2)\n\nThis `value` property is what is accepted for an `input` element value **attribute**, but **not** what the HTML element emits as a value in callbacks. For example, the `onChange` callback type is `value: string`.\n\n## Expected behavior\n\nThe return type on `onValueChange` should be the `HTMLInputElement['value']`. HTML input elements **never**  invoke callbacks passing  `number | undefined | readonly string[]`, they **only** pass type `string`.\n\n```diff\n- onValueChange?: (value: React.ComponentProps<'input'>['value'], event: Event) => void;\n+ onValueChange?: (value: HTMLInputElement['value'], event: Event) => void;\n```\n\nWhen performing simple binding with `useState`, type errors are thrown as a simple `string` type is not sufficent to bind as a controlled value. (see example below)\n\n## Reproducible example\n\n[StackBlitz Example](https://stackblitz.com/edit/vitejs-vite-yh3fjy2u?file=src%2FInput.tsx)\n\n## Base\u00a0UI version\n\n1.0.0-beta.0\n\n## Which browser are you using?\n\nNA\n\n## Which OS are you using?\n\nNA\n\n## Which assistive tech are you using (if applicable)?\n\nNA\n\n## Additional context\n\nNA\n", "closed_by": {"login": "atomiks", "id": 22450188, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks", "html_url": "https://github.com/atomiks", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/2108/reactions", "total_count": 2, "+1": 2, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/2108/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/iss